      "refersTo": "facebook-card",
      "description": "Slate link card under the work photo; only the go-circle fills yellow on hover.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-fb\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-fbi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\"><path d=\"M13.5 21v-7.5h2.6l.4-3h-3V8.6c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.6V4.4c-.3 0-1.2-.1-2.3-.1-2.3 0-3.9 1.4-3.9 4v2.2H7.9v3h2.6V21z\"/></svg></span>Click to see more of our work.<span class=\"ds-go\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-fb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px 18px;min-height:64px;border-radius:10px;background:#23313a;color:#f1efe9;text-decoration:none;font:800 20px/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif} .ds-fbi{flex:none;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#1877f2;display:grid;place-items:center} .ds-go{margin-left:auto;flex:none;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(241,239,233,.35);display:grid;place-items:center;transition:background-color .2s,border-color .2s} .ds-fb:hover .ds-go,.ds-fb:focus-visible .ds-go{background:#f2c230;border-color:#f2c230;color:#1d2830} .ds-fb:focus-visible{outline:none} .ds-fb:focus-visible .ds-go{outline:3px solid #f2c230;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Step Tiles",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "step-tile",
      "description": "Rose-granite numbered tiles beside uppercase step headings.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-steps\"><li><h3>Show us the spot</h3><p>Text a photo or call.</p></li><li><h3>Free estimate</h3><p>A straight price, no charge.</p></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:20px;display:grid;gap:22px;counter-reset:s;background:#d9ddd7;font:400 17px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d2830} .ds-steps li{counter-increment:s;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;gap:4px 16px;align-items:start} .ds-steps li::before{content:counter(s);grid-row:span 2;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:#8a6b6a;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:22px} .ds-steps h3{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1;padding-top:4px} .ds-steps p{margin:0;color:#46555c}"
